# Regenerate generated code

Do not hand-edit generated files.

After changing the source of truth, run the matching generator:

- Wire DI (`pkg/server/wire.go`): `make gen-go`
- CUE kinds (`kinds/`, app kinds): `make gen-cue`
- Feature toggles (`pkg/services/featuremgmt/registry.go`): `make gen-feature-toggles`
- OpenAPI / Swagger specs: `make swagger-gen`

Commit generated output with the source change. Prefer the skill `regenerate-code` when choosing which target to run.
